    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331040/extras/69714d9c9bf0746608ad08435bfc3ac9.avif?t=1749193064\" /></span><br><br>Kassei - Road Cycling is a summer sports simulation game.<br><br>To win the yellow jersey you have to manage your team optimally:<br>as &quot;directeur sportif&quot; you decide on training plans as well as race tactics.<br><br>#RoadCyclingTime<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>real-time gameplay<br>(Play in real-time - or use the &quot;fast-forward&quot; feature!)<br></li><li>various races<br>(tours, classics, ...)<br></li><li>various stages<br>(flat, hilly, mountain, ...)<br></li><li>database editing<br>(Edit the database - and use the &quot;share&quot; feature!)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331040/extras/69714d9c9bf0746608ad08435bfc3ac9.avif?t=1749193064\" /></span><br><br>Kassei - Road Cycling is a summer sports simulation game.<br><br>To win the yellow jersey you have to manage your team optimally:<br>as &quot;directeur sportif&quot; you decide on training plans as well as race tactics.<br><br>#RoadCyclingTime<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>real-time gameplay<br>(Play in real-time - or use the &quot;fast-forward&quot; feature!)<br></li><li>various races<br>(tours, classics, ...)<br></li><li>various stages<br>(flat, hilly, mountain, ...)<br></li><li>database editing<br>(Edit the database - and use the &quot;share&quot; feature!)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Kassei - Road Cycling is a summer sports simulation game. To win the yellow jersey you have to manage your team optimally: as &quot;directeur sportif&quot; you decide on training plans as well as race tactics. #RoadCyclingTime",
